# Reproducer: psi_59 over F_179 on this curve has a single irreducible factor
# of degree 1740.  The old px_ddf() stopped at degree 599 and printed
# "torsion field: not determined"; the old scan also took ~65 s here.  The
# true torsion field is F_179^1740.  This input must finish well under 30 s.
ecdivpoly [91,6] mod 179 59
